      "writtenOn": "2026-05-19T18:07:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It already is a default value there is no value before this, ${VAR:-default_value} is for when you want to use VAR but it might be uninitialized (or empty). In this case we are initializing the variable.\nWe are setting the value, not getting it, the feature you mentioned is for getting a value, not setting it.",
